{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The records this store still keeps at "},{"code":"positions","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", read back for a destination whose"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"delivery buffer dropped them before it received them."}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events","doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/Acknowledger"]]},"metadata":{"role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"Events"}],"externalID":"s:6Events12AcknowledgerP7records2atSayAA11EventRecordVGSays6UInt64VG_tF","remoteSource":{"fileName":"DeliveryTag.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/Traffluent\/blob\/main\/Sources\/Events\/DeliveryTag.swift#L77"},"roleHeading":"Instance Method","required":true,"symbolKind":"method","title":"records(at:)","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"records"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"at"},{"kind":"text","text":": ["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s6UInt64V","text":"UInt64"},{"kind":"text","text":"]) -> ["},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Events11EventRecordV","text":"EventRecord"},{"kind":"text","text":"]"}]},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/events\/acknowledger\/records(at:)"]}],"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"major":0,"patch":0},"defaultImplementationsSections":[{"title":"Acknowledger Implementations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/Acknowledger\/records(at:)-4jg2u"],"anchor":"Acknowledger-Implementations"}],"sections":[],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/Acknowledger\/records(at:)"},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"records","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"at","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"positions","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": [","kind":"text"},{"text":"UInt64","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s6UInt64V"},{"text":"]) -> [","kind":"text"},{"text":"EventRecord","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/EventRecord","preciseIdentifier":"s:6Events11EventRecordV"},{"text":"]","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["Linux"]}]},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The positions of records in this store a delivery handed to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"destinations."}]}],"name":"positions"}]},{"content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"return-value","text":"Return Value","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The records kept at those positions, each tagged with its ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/DeliveryTag","type":"reference"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"naming this store, in any order.","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"},{"content":[{"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion","level":2,"type":"heading"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A delivery calls it once that destination has caught up, hands it the records returned,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"and counts its receipt towards "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/Acknowledger\/acknowledge(_:)","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" for those records alone. A position the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"store no longer keeps (its bound dropped the record, which it reports) gives no record, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"neither does any position when the store can’t read records back, as with the default"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"implementation. The delivery never acknowledges a record it couldn’t hand to every"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"destination, so a store that still keeps one delivers it on a later launch, with"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/EventRecord\/isRedelivered","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" set."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A store of your own should implement it. Without it, the default returns no records, so a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"batch a full buffer dropped isn’t sent again in this run: the destination whose buffer"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"dropped it never gets it in this run, every destination gets it again on the next launch,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"marked redelivered, and the store holds it until then, toward its bound."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The delivery gives each record returned the "},{"type":"reference","isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events\/EventRecord\/isRedelivered"},{"type":"text","text":", the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"sensitive-value visibility and the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"ServiceContext"},{"type":"text","text":" the record had when the buffer dropped"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"it, so a store needn’t keep them. A record tagged with another store is ignored."}]}],"kind":"content"}],"kind":"symbol","references":{"doc://Events/documentation/Events":{"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/events","kind":"symbol","title":"Events","role":"collection","identifier":"doc:\/\/Events\/documentation\/Events","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The types every other module shares: the "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"Event"},{"type":"text","text":" protocol, the values its properties can hold, and the record a tracker makes of each event."}]},"doc://Events/documentation/Events/Ack